		(uuid "19574198-677c-4d10-955c-e06df5e7ca99")
	)
	(text "This voltage divider output\nstill requires buffering and\nprotection from over/under\nvoltage before input into MCU"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 181.102 100.076 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "1de0c553-40b8-48e7-8dc8-eaac245de2aa")
	)
	(text "MOSFETS have 1mΩ on resistance, 1.3Ω gate\nresistance, 23nC loss charge, and ~103nC\ntotal gate charge when charging to 12V.\n\nv_gtdr = 12.6V max, 9V min (3S)\nAfter bootsrap diode:\n11.75V max 8.15V min\n\nIg = Vg / (10+1.3)\nIg = 1.04A max, 0.721A min\n\nA single MOSFET has max 1.2W total loss @ 100kHz, 20A:\nP_sw = 580mW (Ig = 1.04A)\nP_sw = 804mW (Ig = 0.721A)\nP_conduction = 400mW (for 100% duty)\n\nCbootstrap = 10*(103nC/8.15V) = 127nF\nSo use Cbootstrap = 150nF\nSingle MOSFETs max gate drive RMS current is 147mA\n(when switched at 100kHz\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 139.192 49.022 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "47e263c6-d226-4b8d-833c-6ae02000bfc7")
	)
	(text "MOSFETS have 1mΩ on resistance, 1.3Ω gate\nresistance, 23nC loss charge, and ~103nC\ntotal gate charge when charging to 12V.\n\nA single MOSFET has 1W total loss:\nP_sw = 580mW\nP_conduction = 400mW\n(100kHz, 20A, and 100% duty cycle)\n\nR = 11.3V/1A - 1.3 = 10Ω\nCbootstrap = 10*(103nC/11.3V) = 100nF\nSingle MOSFET gate drive RMS current is 144mA\n(when switched at 100kHz\n\n"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 199.136 134.62 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left)
		)
		(uuid "e54181ef-d7af-4a6e-b833-b2491aa07ab4")
	)
